In `encodeTransactionData()` we can see that `tokenGasPriceFactor` is not included:

    ```solidity
        function encodeTransactionData(
            Transaction memory _tx,
            FeeRefund memory refundInfo,
            uint256 _nonce
        ) public view returns (bytes memory) {
            bytes32 safeTxHash =
                keccak256(
                    abi.encode(
